# __ORBIT_PLUGIN_NS__

This skill is linked into the agent skill roots when the plugin is enabled and
unlinked when it is disabled.

## Tools

- `__ORBIT_PLUGIN_NS__.status` — report the plugin's own status. From a shell:
  `orbit __ORBIT_PLUGIN_NS__ status "<subject>"`, which is the same audited
  operation as `orbit tool run __ORBIT_PLUGIN_NS__.status --input '{"subject":"<subject>"}'`.

